<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= map_base \\* t u. (fn : t -> u) (x : array_base t) : array_base u =\n    array x\n    |> arraym::map fn\n    |> \\ (array x : array _) => x\n\n:= collect \\* t r. (fn : t -> array r) (items : array t) : array r =\n    items\n    |> arraym::map fn\n    |> arraym::fold (++) (;[])\n\n:= init_base n fn : array_base _ =\n    arraym::init n fn\n    |> \\ (array x : array _) => x\n\n:= init n : array_base _ =\n    init_base n id\n\n:= choose f l =\n    (l, [])\n    ||> arraym::foldBack \\ x acc =>\n        ?= f x ?|\n        | Some y => y :: acc\n        | None => acc\n    |> arraym::fromList","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := map_base \* t u. (fn : t -> u) (x : array_base t) : array_base u =
      array x
      |> arraym::map fn
      |> \ (array x : array _) => x

  := collect \* t r. (fn : t -> array r) (items : array t) : array r =
      items
      |> arraym::map fn
      |> arraym::fold (++) (;[])

  := init_base n fn : array_base _ =
      arraym::init n fn
      |> \ (array x : array _) => x

  := init n : array_base _ =
      init_base n id

  := choose f l =
      (l, [])
      ||> arraym::foldBack \ x acc =>
          ?= f x ?|
          | Some y => y :: acc
          | None => acc
      |> arraym::fromList
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

