#### new_vec_keeps_a_list_built_at_runtime (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n\n:~ ^ build (n : i32) (acc : list i32) : list i32 = ? n <= 0i32 ?> acc |: build (n - 1i32) (n :: acc)\n:= ~count = 3i32\nbuild count [] |> new_vec |> vec_len |> convert::i32 |> _assert_eq 3i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust

  :~ ^ build (n : i32) (acc : list i32) : list i32 = ? n <= 0i32 ?> acc |: build (n - 1i32) (n :: acc)
  := ~count = 3i32
  build count [] |> new_vec |> vec_len |> convert::i32 |> _assert_eq 3i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

